    <!-- ── Hint bodies ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <string name="hint_body_battle_intro">Blue tiles show your movement range. Choose a skill to mark targets. Tap \'End Turn\' when you\'re done.</string>
    <string name="hint_body_skills">Skills cost mana. You regenerate 5 mana automatically each round. Greyed-out skills are too expensive right now.</string>
    <string name="hint_body_conditions">🔥 Burn, ☠ Poison, and ❄ Chill deal damage each turn. 🛡 Block absorbs incoming hits. Multiple stacks amplify the effect.</string>
    <string name="hint_body_overworld">Choose your path through the map. Reachable nodes light up. Rest sites let you recover HP between fights.</string>
    <string name="hint_body_rest">You can rest here to recover some HP. You can also move on without resting — save your strength for later!</string>
    <string name="hint_body_level_up">You gained a level and receive 2 attribute points. Visit the Character screen to increase STR, DEX, CON, INT, WIS, or CHA.</string>
    <string name="hint_body_relic">Relics grant permanent bonuses for the rest of this run — from more HP to mana or XP bonuses. Each relic can only be held once.</string>
    <string name="hint_body_boss">A powerful enemy awaits. Bosses have high HP, strong attacks, and scale with your progress. Go in well prepared!</string>
